Now I need to understand the change carefully.

The current code in main is:
```c
if (!TIFFRGBAImageGet(&img, ...)) {
    // error
}
```

The PR changes it to:
```c
if (TIFFRGBAImageGet(&img, ...) == -1) {
    // error
}
```

According to libtiff documentation, `TIFFRGBAImageGet` returns 1 on success and 0 on failure. So `!TIFFRGBAImageGet(...)` is the correct error check. Changing to `== -1` means it would never detect errors (since libtiff returns 0 on failure, not -1).

